<title>USA: Designer Holdings Ltd Q3 pro forma shr rises.</title>
<headline>Designer Holdings Ltd Q3 pro forma shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>($ in thousands, except share data)</p>
<p> Pro Forma Results:  Three Months Ended     Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>			   9/30/96     9/30/95    9/30/96   9/30/95</p>
<p> Net revenues	   136,884     89,040    356,487   211,540</p>
<p> Net earnings	    11,266	5,809     24,714    12,337</p>
<p> Net earnings per share  0.35	 0.18	 0.76	0.38</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>		   32,477,222  32,159,334  32,376,017  32,159,334</p>
<p>Actual Results:</p>
<p>Net earnings before</p>
<p>  extraordinary item   11,266	3,932     22,261     7,903</p>
<p> Extraordinary item	  --	   --	2,256	  --</p>
<p> Net earnings	    11,266	3,932     20,005     7,903</p>
<p>Net earnings per share</p>
<p>before extraordinary item</p>
<p>				 0.35	 0.16	 0.78	0.33</p>
<p> Net earnings per share  0.35	 0.16	 0.70	0.33</p>
<p>Weighted average common</p>
<p>shares outstanding</p>
<p>		   32,477,222  24,233,868  28,710,441  24,233,868</p>
<p>NOTE - Pro forma results are to reflect the company having gone public in May 1996.</p>
<p>The extraordinary item reflects the early extinguishment of debt.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
